# Dirs bazel must not scan for packages (`//...` would trip on non-build BUILD files).
.claude
target
# Parity corpus = real Bazel projects (test fixtures), not part of the razel build. The cc +
# java dirs are kept (shadowed by their own BUILD.bazel) because razel-loading/razel-cc-toolchain
# tests read their goldens; rust isn't referenced.
parity/corpus/rust/transitive
